Let me also ask: did you have two loops, one over words, one over
files? If yes, were they nested like this

for (i in files) {
   for (j in ngrams) {
      get dispersions
   }
}

or like this

for (i in ngrams) {
   for (j in files) {
      get dispersions
   }
}

?

STG
